{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/271896-2-5-abyssal-homebrew-lets-do-something-creative-with-resonance","id":271896,"title":"2.5 Abyssal Homebrew: Lets do something creative with Resonance.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-03T17:44:26-07:00","id":271896,"title":"2.5 Abyssal Homebrew: Lets do something creative with Resonance.","content":"The true test pushing the Abyssal is not mental limit but the curse of the neverborn. It is something they must figure out how to use, how to channel, how to handle. I would normally just vent my resonance but I'm traveling with a Mortal (PC), a Lunar(pc), my Elemental Lover (Fire Duck who's reaching lesser elemental dragon level), and a DragonBlood (PC). If I blow my 7 points of resonance now my renegade will kill the mortal, but if I build up another 3 points the resonance nuke will kill her anyway. I need a way to SAFELY vent resonance. That's when I remembered Resonance Ben of KoC and I thought, wait what if I could channel that resonance into something useful, destructive but useful.<br /> <br /> So I bring forward....for much balancing, and consideration<br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">(Ability) DEATH ESSENCE </span><br /> <b>cost:</b> 1wp; <b>Mins:</b> (Ability) 5, Essence 3; <b>Type: </b>Supplemental<br /> <b>Keywords:</b> Combo-ok; <b>Duration:</b> instant<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms:</b> Ravening Mouth of Ability<br /> Learning to channel the punishment of the neverborn into a single action in ways the neverborn never thought possible, some renegade and loyalist deathknights have shown an uncanny ability to unleash the wrath of death upon their enemies. Targets struck with attacks augmented by this charm have shadowlands form within their own bodies, unliving targets decay and rot away, and even things made of the 5 magical materials become in peril as the essence of death turns and warps them, causing essence cascades and flows to backfire and corrupt. Automatons find their gears stripping and missing and falling loose, as their essence relays misfire.<br /> Attacks augmented with (Ability) Death Essence vents an amount of resonance determined with a normal player controlled essence vent, and channel that into a single attack. The attack deals a number of levels of damage equal to resonance vented, as a shadowland forms within the body of victim. Victims struck by this attack loose 1 random intimacy, if they have any. If the attack does a number of levels of damage equal to subjects MDV: They lose their motivation instead.<br /> (Ability) Death Essence may let the death knight transfer some of his bane away from himself but that does not mean he does not it is all without problems. Those using the charm for one seen count all motes spent as peripheral motes for the rest of the scene. In addition because of the frights that radiate out from him the death knight takes an external penalty equal to his own essence score to all social rolls, Larceny rolls, stealth rolls until the sundown the following day. This penalty lasts for the rest of the day. If this charm is used multiple times, these effects stack!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":600,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","user":"HaplessWithDice","date":". 10-05-2014, 10:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T17:48:16-07:00","id":271915,"title":"","content":"This turns Resonance from a drawback into a straight benefit, completely reversing its role in the game.<br /> <br /> You do get that Resonance Bet was a joke and that his Resonance-based fighting style was supposed to be him munchkining the rules of the game to hell and back, right?<br /> <br /> On the other hand, still better than RAW!<br /> <br /> Just don't use Resonance. It's not worth the trouble.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T18:02:00-07:00","id":271922,"title":"","content":"Actually it wasn't really a problem when the party consisted of an Elemental, a dragon blood, and a Lunar. But when our new player joined an wanted to play a mortal...that just created a problem. And given that I gained 2 points of resonance in one game session, nearly a third...you can see why I'm a bit worried. I'm already on resonance 7. Though I could probably have it afflict the user with the all essence points spent for rest of scene count as perferial, and maybe some other draw back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T06:30:20-07:00","id":272178,"title":"","content":"While things would be better if your group was using Shard's Black Doom, I would agree that focusing the eruptions on the categories that hurt you would be best. Though why would your ST allow your punishment to kill a fellow PC? I haven't had a chance to play an RPG before, but from what I've read that sounds terribly rude.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T08:21:37-07:00","id":272223,"title":"","content":"The problem is books like Abyssals and Infernals assume that any mortals in the party are NPC's or disposable. An Abyssal who blows a resonance bomb is likely to kill everyone mortal they care about. Unborn mortal,and animal babies around them die in the womb and are stillborn at a high enough eruption.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T20:33:49-07:00","id":272690,"title":"","content":"Why not a charm that &quot;baptizes&quot; a Mortal, causing them to become a Creature of Death (and therefore not subject to random Resonance Hissy Fits)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T21:26:29-07:00","id":272703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/271896-2-5-abyssal-homebrew-lets-do-something-creative-with-resonance?p=272690#post272690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why not a charm that &quot;baptizes&quot; a Mortal, causing them to become a Creature of Death (and therefore not subject to random Resonance Hissy Fits)?</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't help but imagine this either turning them into a Khaucon or making it easier for them to become one, considering the speaker.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/357-plotvitalnpc","name":"PlotVitalNPC","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T22:11:19-07:00","id":272737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PlotVitalNPC</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/271896-2-5-abyssal-homebrew-lets-do-something-creative-with-resonance?p=272703#post272703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can't help but imagine this either turning them into a Khaucon or making it easier for them to become one, considering the speaker.</div> </div> </div> </div>Before my actual post quick thing Khaucon are what?<br /> <br /> Yeah allowing the players charms that let them straight out weaponize their resonance without the drawbacks of triggering resonance burst is a bad idea. I get the concern about the other person's character and the fact that most of the bursts will likely end in his death, also glad you care as opposed to just saying &quot;eh f*ck em. Should have known not to play mortal.&quot; like I've seen from people in other games. Reasonably I would say the ST isn't going to have a resonance burst just flat out no-save-kill another pc, even if they are playing the squishiest thing in the party by an order of magnitude, but more likely you'll need something to protect them as opposed to making resonance a tool the player can charge to superweapon levels by saying &quot;Hello, I'm Bob.&quot;<br /> <br /> The first option of handling it is regular essence venting along the paths that are more controllable and then just staying away when you gotta vent. Another would be If you have someone with occult knowledge and some craft maybe create something that allows the mortal resistance to resonance bursts, so that the mortal is about as protected as the exalts. If all else fails check with the player and the ST see if they don't mind having the guy exalt after taking the burst and &quot;miraculously&quot; surviving (or not if they decide to be an abyssal).<br /> <br /> I will also point out if your character is the type who would do it then there is a way of removing resonance without venting it. Find something rare and wonderous and destroy it utterly while dedicating the destruction to the Neverborn. Or find some people your character can't stand like hates with a fiery passion and dedicate their horrific and painful ends to the Neverborn. Again only if your character is the kind of person who would be willing to do this kind of thing to protect his new mortal ally. I will also point out that these things destroyed need not be good, so if you happen across some horrific spell or artifact spreading disease and death to an unwitting and doomed countryside that works too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T22:39:45-07:00","id":272756,"title":"","content":"Adding a few drawbacks, as if it were a minor eruption but the idea is that it transfers the dark fate to the victim. Adding in some drawback though for the use. A scene long minor stigmata, and a day long Branding effect. The Above charm will now be edited to mach these effects so they add up to 3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T23:58:16-07:00","id":272784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HaplessWithDice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/271896-2-5-abyssal-homebrew-lets-do-something-creative-with-resonance?p=272756#post272756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Adding a few drawbacks, as if it were a minor eruption but the idea is that it transfers the dark fate to the victim. Adding in some drawback though for the use. A scene long minor stigmata, and a day long Branding effect. The Above charm will now be edited to mach these effects so they add up to 3</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay explain what you mean here please. &quot; it transfers the dark fate to the victim.&quot; Ok, so maybe I'm missing something, but the dark fate is defined in the abyssal book as what causes abyssals to build up resonance. So from what you said there you're at best not getting this approved because you're taking it away your resonance penalty by hitting some random enemy with it and thus losing it on your own, and at worst you've created a charm that allows infecting living beings with the resonance penalty including the bursts. Bright side the Neverborn will probably like you for doing this and be willing to remove the resonance you built up that day.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T08:08:41-07:00","id":272939,"title":"","content":"I was using in this case Dark Fate to mean the outburst of resonance effects. And I'm taking away the Resonance penalty the ST asked me to take away, and leaving the ones that only effect me. For example the cutting away of an intimacy (Conduit 1 effect), or the automatic levels of damage (the blight effect as their body/corpus/housing turns into a self contained shadowland.) but the Stigmata, and Branding effects are still there, and the branding effect is now worse. Applying an external penalty, rather than an internal, and lasting till sundown the next day, so around 24 to 40 hours.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}